⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
328 calories 36g protein (for the entire pint, toppings/mix-ins included)

Choco-lotta Cheesecake Sundae Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Full recipe book (160+ flavors) linked in bio!

- 1 Chocolate Protein Shake (350-400ml)  
- 20-25g Monk Fruit sweetener
- 22g (2 tbsp) whipped (or regular) cream cheese
- 10g cocoa powder
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins/toppings:
- 3 Oreo Thins (cream removed)
- 10g (4 tbsp) Fat Free Reddiwhip (or any whipped cream)
- ¼ of a Salted Fudge Hormbles Chormbles, chopped (protein chocolate bar with 100 cal and 10g pro)
- 10g (2 tsp) Lakanto Chocolate Sauce
328 cal 30g C, 12g F, 36g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting if necessary
5. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with the Oreos
6. Run the “Mix-in” cycle
7. Top with the whipped cream, chocolate sauce, and chopped chocolate bar pieces

